Job description:
PT Asuransi Raksa Pratikara is looking for a software engineer to help expand and enhance the company’s portfolio of software applications. Raksa’s portfolio of applications encompasses a wide range of software, including consumer-facing web applications, B2B APIs, internal servers and mobile native apps. Additionally, Raksa’s applications are deployed both on-premises as well as in the cloud. As a result, the ideal candidate will have a strong interest in learning about and working on a wide range of applications and technologies. While there is no requirement for a specific programming language for this position, experience with PHP, JavaScript/TypeScript or Python are a plus. Additionally, experience with NextJS/React, Android/iOS and serverless cloud architectures are also positives. Since Raksa’s software engineers work in small teams and utilize an agile development workflow, the ideal candidate should enjoy working in a fast-paced and collaborative environment.


Requirements :

S1 fresh graduate from a reputable university with a minimum GPA of 2.75;

Minimum of 1 year of experience in software development using any programming language;

Strong understanding of fundamental software engineering concepts, algorithms and design patterns;

Experience developing mobile applications (iOS and/or Android) is a plus;

Experience working with cloud platforms (e.g., Amazon AWS, Google Compute Cloud or Microsoft Azure) and developing serverless applications is a plus;

Passionate about learning and using new technologies in a fast-paced environment;

Excellent collaborative and communication skills.

Frontend Engineer (Vue / Admin System)

Responsibilities

1. Develop and maintain frontend systems based on Vue;

2. Build and optimize admin dashboards (content review, data dashboards, task

management, etc.);

3. Integrate with backend APIs and implement data display and interaction logic;

4. Participate in UI structure design and user experience optimization;

5. Continuously improve frontend performance and code quality;




Requirements

1. At least 2 years of frontend development experience;

2. Strong proficiency in JavaScript / HTML / CSS;

3. Proficient in Vue (Vue 3 preferred) with solid component-based development skills;

4. Familiar with UI frameworks such as Element Plus or Ant Design Vue;

5. Experienced in API integration (Axios / Fetch) and frontend-backend separation;

6. Familiar with Git or other version control tools;

7. Good coding standards and development practices;




Core Competencies (Must Have)

1. Experience in building admin/backend management systems (key requirement);

2. Ability to independently implement common features such as lists, filtering, pagination, and state management;

3. Ability to understand business workflows (e.g., review processes, state transitions) and implement corresponding UI logic;

4. Ability to independently integrate with backend APIs and complete feature development;




Preferred Qualifications

1. Experience with data dashboards or charting tools (e.g., ECharts);

2. Experience with permission management systems (roles/menus);

3. Experience in e-commerce or content platforms;

4. Experience in frontend performance optimization;


Keywords

Vue3 / Admin System / API Integration / Data Dashboard / Content Review System

C# Backend Engineer (API Integration)

1. Responsibilities

1. Develop and maintain backend systems based on C# (ASP.NET Core);

2. Integrate with third-party platform APIs (e.g., TikTok, Shopify);

3. Design and implement core business workflows (content moderation, task

processing, data handling, etc.);

4. Handle data collection, processing, and storage related to video/content;

5. Participate in system architecture design to improve scalability and stability;

6. Develop scheduled tasks, asynchronous jobs, and data synchronization processes;

7. Collaborate closely with frontend engineers and product managers to deliver

features efficiently.

2. Requirements

1. Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or related field is preferred;

2. 3+ years of backend development experience;

3. Proficient in C# and familiar with ASP.NET Core (.NET 6 or above);

4. Strong understanding of RESTful API design and development;

5. Hands-on experience with third-party API integration (required);

6. Familiar with OAuth2 authentication and authorization mechanisms;

7. Experience with relational databases such as MySQL or PostgreSQL;

8. Familiar with Redis (caching, distributed locks, etc.);

9. Experience with NoSQL databases such as MongoDB is a plus;

10. Familiar with asynchronous programming (async/await) and task scheduling tools

(e.g., Hangfire / Quartz.NET);

11. Experience with message queues (e.g., RabbitMQ / Kafka) is a plus;

12. Basic knowledge of Linux and experience with Docker is preferred.

3. Preferred Qualifications

1. Experience with TikTok API or e-commerce platform APIs (e.g., Shopify);

2. Experience building content platforms, moderation systems, or distribution

systems;

3. Experience with data analytics, reporting, or commission systems;

4. Experience handling high-concurrency or large-scale data processing;

5. Experience in system architecture design or owning end-to-end projects.

4. We Expect You To Have

• Strong coding standards and engineering practices;

• Excellent problem-solving skills;

• Good communication and teamwork abilities;

• Strong execution and willingness to learn new technologies.

5. Keywords

C# / ASP.NET Core / API Integration / TikTok API / Shopify API / OAuth2 / Redis /

MongoDB / Async Jobs / Data Processing

